 "steps": [
  {
   "section": "prep",
   "text": "Chop the cilantro, mint and jalapeño as finely as you can and stir them into the yogurt with the lime juice and a pinch of salt for the chutney. Slice the onion and cut the cucumber."
  },
  {
   "section": "stovetop",
   "text": "Heat a little oil in a skillet over medium heat. Pour in 1 beaten egg with a pinch of salt and garam masala, lay a tortilla on top and cook until the egg sets, about 1 minute; flip and cook 30 seconds. Repeat for each roll.",
